<tr><td><em>Trichophyton</em></td><td>Smooth walled；用於鑑定</td><td>Absent 或 nondiagnostic</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>Microsporum</em></td><td>Absent 或 nondiagnostic</td><td><strong>Rough walled</strong>；用於鑑定</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>Epidermophyton</em></td><td><strong>Absent</strong></td><td>Smooth walled；用於鑑定</td></tr>
